  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born into the Hatchling Plague, Quackenstein never knew a world without the toxic haze. He scavenged the ruins of Subchain City, quickly learning to survive using wit and a scavenged crowbar. The 'Hooded Blood Stained DDC patch' he wears is a grim reminder of a flock he lost to a DRIP raid gone south.",
    "class": "Plague Scavenger",
    "name": "Quackenstein",
    "personality": "Grimly Pragmatic: Quackenstein sees the world in shades of gray and does what's necessary to survive, even if it means bending the rules. Resourceful: He can MacGyver his way out of most situations, using scraps and ingenuity. Intimidating: Quackenstein knows how to wield his crowbar, and his hardened stare can send most ducks running.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "When the chips are down, Quackenstein can channel the toxic fumes of his upbringing to unleash a crippling wave of poison. This coats enemies in a haze that weakens their attacks, leaving them more vulnerable to subsequent attacks.",
